    all other prose in src/content/ — is not covered by the MIT grant.
    All rights reserved.

  * The portrait photograph (public/headshot.jpg) is not covered by the MIT
    grant. All rights reserved.

  * The pixel art and sound in this project are generated procedurally by the
    source code rather than shipped as asset files, so they fall under the MIT
